{"vid":"LRUNADqk-hY","source":"LRUNADqk-hY.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"you"},{"t":3.1,"txt":"so when I started my career in this"},{"t":5.5,"txt":"industry my number one goal was to be"},{"t":8.5,"txt":"thirsty for knowledge try to add as many"},{"t":10.7,"txt":"things to my toolbox as I possibly could"},{"t":13.8,"txt":"my name is jake ross i was a avionics"},{"t":17.2,"txt":"electronics technician second class"},{"t":18.5,"txt":"petty officer in the United States Navy"},{"t":20.3,"txt":"and now I've been in the welding and"},{"t":22.1,"txt":"fabrication industry for the last seven"},{"t":23.8,"txt":"years my current role is a distribution"},{"t":26.6,"txt":"sales manager for Hypertherm during my"},{"t":29,"txt":"military experience I started off with"},{"t":30.9,"txt":"going boot camp and Great Lakes just"},{"t":33.2,"txt":"north of Chicago from there I went to"},{"t":35.6,"txt":"what we would call a school in the Navy"},{"t":38.9,"txt":"where I learned basic avionics after"},{"t":42,"txt":"learning basic avionics I got stationed"},{"t":44.3,"txt":"in the Pacific Northwest on Whidbey"},{"t":46.5,"txt":"Island on Naval Air Station Whidbey"},{"t":48.6,"txt":"Welding is a really good career for"},{"t":50.7,"txt":"veterans that are returning home because"},{"t":53.6,"txt":"you know it's a technical skill you know"},{"t":56.1,"txt":"this isn't something that you're gonna"},{"t":57.7,"txt":"learn overnight but it's something that"},{"t":59.9,"txt":"can be a career for a very long time and"},{"t":61.9,"txt":"then the need for welders will always be"},{"t":64.5,"txt":"there because we always need to be able"},{"t":66.3,"txt":"to fabricate metal you know some of the"},{"t":69.1,"txt":"skills that transfer from the military"},{"t":71,"txt":"is you know project planning where you"},{"t":73.8,"txt":"gotta plan out what you're gonna"},{"t":75.7,"txt":"particularly do whether with a"},{"t":77.5,"txt":"particular project time management in"},{"t":80.7,"txt":"terms of you know we have a deadline"},{"t":82.4,"txt":"that we have to meet so there's a lot of"},{"t":84.4,"txt":"a lot of skills that transfer from the"},{"t":86.5,"txt":"military there are better general skills"},{"t":88.2,"txt":"that will really help you out in a"},{"t":90.5,"txt":"career in welding yeah I think there's a"},{"t":93,"txt":"big misconception that if you're gonna"},{"t":94.7,"txt":"be a welder that you're gonna start off"},{"t":96.6,"txt":"well then you're gonna be stuck welding"},{"t":98.5,"txt":"in the same booth every day and the"},{"t":100.8,"txt":"reality is is that that's just not true"},{"t":102.9,"txt":"one things I did was I wanted to"},{"t":105.5,"txt":"a lot more about robotics so when I"},{"t":108,"txt":"learned more about robotics they"},{"t":109.4,"txt":"transitioned me into a role that was"},{"t":111.2,"txt":"more focused on supporting our robotic"},{"t":113.8,"txt":"end users and from there it was a a"},{"t":117,"txt":"great pivot point for me to move into a"},{"t":118.9,"txt":"sales career and in a territory where"},{"t":120.9,"txt":"robotic welding was extremely a big part"},{"t":125.4,"txt":"of the market so there's really two"},{"t":127.8,"txt":"sides to the the welding industry you"},{"t":130,"txt":"have the the hands-on side and then you"},{"t":132.2,"txt":"have which the hands-on side I would"},{"t":134.4,"txt":"classify as a technical side of things"},{"t":136.4,"txt":"and then you have the business side so"},{"t":139.1,"txt":"one things that you do on the business"},{"t":140.4,"txt":"side is with a technical background"},{"t":142.1,"txt":"you're you're looking for technical"},{"t":144.1,"txt":"solutions for end-users customers that"},{"t":147.8,"txt":"would be using equipment for instance"},{"t":149.3,"txt":"and on the hands-on side you're you're"},{"t":152.1,"txt":"actually physically providing that"},{"t":154.1,"txt":"solution whether it's at the customer or"},{"t":156.5,"txt":"doing a test and a welding lab like"},{"t"